{:benchmark-repo/id "prf/benchmarks"
 :version 1
 :description "Canonical benchmark repository. See benchmarks/ for structure.
   Catalogue entries are classified by status in :catalogue; the :benchmarks
   vector below is the complete flat list (slug -> manifest), kept intact so
   existing consumers resolve slugs unchanged. Status lives in the registries
   (registry.edn, packs/*/registry.edn); :catalogue mirrors it for readers."

